# The scan sandbox's image is built from the app root with this list
# (docker/companion/Dockerfile; the release image, which is also the companion's,
# has docker/Dockerfile.dockerignore, and every other build its own context). This
# list admits only what it copies (src/appstamp.ts BAKED_PATHS, entry for entry —
# the stamp is a hash over exactly these). Everything else in the checkout —
# state, evidence, node_modules, the operator's files — stays out.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!dist
!packages/pi-plugin
!src
!extensions
!agents
!prompts
!seeds
!profiles
!docker/companion
packages/pi-plugin/assets
**/node_modules
**/.git
